  <div class="about-content">
    <p>
      I am a software engineer with a strong background in DevOps, 
      specializing in Python and automation. With nine years at Veracode, I developed a deep understanding of SAST product, and building tools for a SaaS company.
      I honed my skills in security, system reliability, and regulatory compliance.
    </p>
    <p>
      During my time in the industry, I automated processes using GitLab CI/CD and levraged tools like Docker to streamline operations and produce consistency. 
      Also was exposed to leadership roles, where I lead the team and help onboard new team members. 
      My most significant achievement was recompiling an in-house test suite using Python and Docker, 
      handling a variety of languages and ensuring compatibility with the latest compiler versions. 
      Additionally, have participated in the transformation of migrating services from an on-prem datacenter to cloud services. 
      Experience with AWS services, such as security groups, IAM, EC2, S3, cloud watch, AWS CLI
    </p>
    <p>
      At the present moment I am also exploring AI tools like OpenWebUI, LiteLLm, and RAG models, 
      applying my knowledge to build local models for extracting information from complex documents, as well as improving my prompts!
    </p>
    <p>
      My work style is flexible; I thrive both independently on short tasks and collaboratively on complex projects. 
      Whether working alone or in a team, I enjoy finding the best approach that yields the best results.
    </p>
